    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/6cb329524552c32b21070724c1120031.poster.avif?t=1750417276\" width=730 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/6cb329524552c32b21070724c1120031.webm?t=1750417276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/6cb329524552c32b21070724c1120031.mp4?t=1750417276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>&quot;Wishlist &amp; follow if you're curious \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f \u2014 it helps a <i>lot</i> to spread the word!&quot;</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Gut Eater</strong> \u2013 A psychological horror experience where your only mission is to take care of a cat... unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 A mysterious package. Inside, a creature that stares at you, tests you\u2026 and waits. It\u2019s no ordinary pet \u2014 it\u2019s a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf56 Feed him. Entertain him. Touch him. Survive. But the more you play, the deeper he slips into your mind\u2026 and your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 \ud83d\ude28 An oppressive game: he knows when you hesitate, he knows when you're afraid.<br>\ud83d\udd39 \ud83e\udde0 Horror that breaks the screen: what if your nightmare became real?<br>\ud83d\udd39 \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f A constant sense of unease: are you playing\u2026 or being played?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa You\u2019re locked in with him. And he\u2019s hungry. \ud83e\udd2e\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\ud83e\udec0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/ffba01236adfc8f18594e1ab39393025.avif?t=1750417276\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/6cb329524552c32b21070724c1120031.poster.avif?t=1750417276\" width=730 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/6cb329524552c32b21070724c1120031.webm?t=1750417276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/6cb329524552c32b21070724c1120031.mp4?t=1750417276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>&quot;Wishlist &amp; follow if you're curious \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f \u2014 it helps a <i>lot</i> to spread the word!&quot;</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Gut Eater</strong> \u2013 A psychological horror experience where your only mission is to take care of a cat... unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 A mysterious package. Inside, a creature that stares at you, tests you\u2026 and waits. It\u2019s no ordinary pet \u2014 it\u2019s a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf56 Feed him. Entertain him. Touch him. Survive. But the more you play, the deeper he slips into your mind\u2026 and your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 \ud83d\ude28 An oppressive game: he knows when you hesitate, he knows when you're afraid.<br>\ud83d\udd39 \ud83e\udde0 Horror that breaks the screen: what if your nightmare became real?<br>\ud83d\udd39 \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f A constant sense of unease: are you playing\u2026 or being played?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa You\u2019re locked in with him. And he\u2019s hungry. \ud83e\udd2e\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\ud83e\udec0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/ffba01236adfc8f18594e1ab39393025.avif?t=1750417276\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p>",
